      "writtenOn": "2019-09-19T20:44:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The TCPC_DRP_TOGGLE, LPM_REQUESTED, and LPM_ENGAGED flags seem to be handled correctly now, so the DrpAutoToggle to Unattached.SNK bounce between only occurs twice before low power mode is entered. Here is a printout of entering low power mode:\n\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.735775 power state 3 \u003d S0, in 0x0019]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 RTC: 0x00011770 (71536.00 s)\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.736663 power state 8 \u003d S0-\u003eS3, in 0x0019]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.739251 PD:S0-\u003eS3]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 RTC: 0x00011770 (71536.00 s)\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.741591 power state 2 \u003d S3, in 0x0019]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 RTC: 0x00011770 (71536.00 s)\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.742314 power state 9 \u003d S3-\u003eS5, in 0x0019]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.744882 PD:S3-\u003eS5]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.745963 Lid Accel ODR: 10000 - roundRTC: 0x00011770 (71536.00 s)\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.746751 power state 1 \u003d S5, in 0x0019]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 up 1 from config 2 [AP 0]]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 i2c 2 recovery! error code is 7, current state is 0\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.750518 C1: Unattached.SNK]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.751643 C1: AttachWait.SNK]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.776151 C1: Unattached.SRC]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.782713 C1: DRPAutoToggle]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.789808 C1: Unattached.SNK]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.796053 C1: DRPAutoToggle]\n2019-09-19 11:29:16 [423.806882 TCPC p1 Enter Low Power Mode]\n2019-09-19 11:29:20 Port 80 writes:\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   0e 13 14 15 7f 00 01 14 16 20 23 24 32 4f 50 5f 15 20 21 22\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   23 24 28 3f 4f 40 41 42 47 61 63 03 04 05 06 07 0f 65 64 6f\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   0f 99 72 24 25 24 25 55 55 73 94 94 74 75 75 75 75 75 75 75\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75\n2019-09-19 11:29:20   75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 75 76 77 79 9c 93 7a 95 05 25 95